I don't know what the future holds for widespread adoption of Lojban.
Neither do I know if it will yeild measurable scientific insights. I
enjoy speaking a language that has so much functional elegance. In the
real world, we have to be compatible with everybody else
even if the existing monopoly is something defective. For me I like to
imagine what native Lojban speakers would be like in a world where
longstanding
traditions are discarded for that which has the most intrinsic merit. I
go into more detail on my page about why I am learning Lojban:<br>
